<!-- [XPLAT] migrated from net48/WinForms — see MIGRATION_DOCS/TRANSITION_MAP.md -->
<!--
    [XPLAT] AgOpenGPS (GPS program) — "Tracks" Track-Manager dialog (Avalonia view).

    1:1 visual + behavioural PARITY reimplementation of the deleted WinForms
    `Forms/Guidance/FormBuildTracks` (FormBuildTracks.cs + FormBuildTracks.Designer.cs). This is the
    full Track Manager: a track LIST (panelMain) plus a multi-mode track BUILDER reached through a
    chooser (panelChoose) — Curve, AB line, A+, Lat/Lon+Heading, Lat/Lon Lat/Lon, Pivot, and KML
    import. It is the largest dialog in the Guidance folder: eleven overlapping sub-panels share the
    same top-left origin (3,3) and the code-behind shows exactly one at a time, resizing the window
    per active panel. Per AAP §0.3.3 this is a faithful parity reimplementation of the current
    Windows Forms look — never a redesign: no new fields, no relayout, no UX changes.

    WIRING CONTRACT — this view is a CODE-BEHIND dialog, NOT MVVM (exactly like the sibling
    FormRecordPickerView / FormSimCoordsView):
      * There is intentionally NO x:DataType and NO DataContext on the view. The partner code-behind
        (FormBuildTracksView.axaml.cs) owns ALL behaviour and addresses every control imperatively
        BY x:Name. Consequently NO Click handlers are declared in this markup (the schema/agent
        prompt mandates "Wire handlers in code-behind (not XAML)"); every named control below MUST
        keep its EXACT x:Name so the code-behind compiles and binds against it. This also lets the
        markup compile without depending on the (separately authored) handler method names.
      * Panel switching + window resize: FormBuildTracks_Load repositions every sub-panel to (3,3)
        and shows only panelMain; entering a builder mode swaps the visible panel and resizes the
        window (650x480 main/choose, 270x360, 370x460, 370x360). The code-behind owns that logic;
        here all panels are pre-positioned at (3,3) with only panelMain IsVisible="True".
      * Title: the WinForms designer Text was "Tracks"; the code-behind overrides it at runtime with
        the localized gStr.gsTracks — the same Title-in-code-behind convention used by the sibling
        FormRecordPickerView / FormSimCoordsView. The design-time Title below is the literal default.
      * Localised captions: the label Text values below are the WinForms designer defaults; the
        code-behind (re)assigns the translated strings (gStr.*) at runtime.

    THE TRACK LIST (flp): the WinForms FlowLayoutPanel built THREE controls per track in add-order
    b (mode icon) -> t (name) -> a (visible toggle). It is reimplemented here as an
    <ItemsControl x:Name="flp"> inside a <ScrollViewer> (white, 450 x 399). The ItemTemplate renders
    that exact three-control row left-to-right. The code-behind owns a backing collection of a small
    row view-type and the selection/visibility logic (WinForms UpdateTable / A_Click /
    LineSelected_Click): name Click selects (highlight LightBlue when visible), visible Click toggles
    isVisible (Green/Red + name fg Black/Gray), the mode icon has no click (drag only). Touch-drag
    scrolling (WinForms StartDrag/DoDrag) is reproduced in code-behind by adjusting the ScrollViewer
    (flpScroll) offset on pointer drag. Because no x:DataType is declared and the root sets
    x:CompileBindings="False", every {Binding} in the row template is a reflection binding — the row
    view-type's PROPERTY NAMES are the contract:
        Name (string)             -> the name button caption
        NameBackground (IBrush)   -> LightBlue when selected else AliceBlue
        NameForeground (IBrush)   -> Black when visible else Gray
        ModeImage (IImage)        -> TrackLine (AB) / TrackPivot (pivot) / TrackCurve (curve)
        VisibleBackground (IBrush)-> Green when visible else Red
    The three row buttons carry marker Classes (trackMode / trackName / trackVisible) so the
    code-behind can attach the bubbled Click handlers without per-row markup wiring.

    WINDOW SHELL — mirrors FormBuildTracks.Designer.cs:
      BackColor WhiteSmoke        -> Background="WhiteSmoke" (the designer's literal control colour;
                                     this dialog is a plain control-coloured surface, not day/night
                                     chrome, so it is NOT themed with AogFrameBrush).
      FormBorderStyle FixedSingle -> SystemDecorations="Full" + CanResize="False".
      ControlBox / Max / Min = false : there is no portable way to hide ONLY the close/min/max
                                     buttons while keeping a system title bar, so the standard
                                     decorations are kept (CanResize="False" makes it fixed-size).
      ShowInTaskbar = false       -> ShowInTaskbar="False".
      StartPosition CenterParent  -> WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner".
      Load size 650 x 480         -> initial Width="650" Height="480" (panelMain default; the
                                     code-behind resizes per active panel).
      Font Tahoma                 -> FontFamily="Tahoma".

    Button glyphs are served from the GPS assembly via avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/<name>.png,
    matching the on-disk file casing and the avares:// convention already used by every sibling GPS
    view. Two non-obvious assets: the A+ chooser tile uses btnImages/ABTrackA+.png (the literal '+'
    is part of the file name and is a valid, undecoded character in an avares URI path), and the
    three "fill from antenna" buttons use the sub-foldered btnImages/Config/ConS_ImplementAntenna.png
    (sub-folder glyphs are referenced the same way by the sibling FormSteerView).

    WinForms font pt -> Avalonia DIP = pt * 96/72: 9.75->13, 11.25->15, 14.25->19, 18->24,
    21.75->29, 24->32, 27.75->37.
-->
<Window xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        x:Class="AgOpenGPS.Views.FormBuildTracksView"
        Title="Tracks"
        Width="650"
        Height="480"
        Background="{DynamicResource AogLegacyWhiteSmokeBrush}"
        SystemDecorations="Full"
        CanResize="False"
        ShowInTaskbar="False"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner"
        FontFamily="Tahoma"
        x:CompileBindings="False">

    <Window.Styles>

        <!-- WinForms labels were Black / ControlText on the light panels. -->
        <Style Selector="TextBlock">
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="Black" />
        </Style>

        <!-- Flat, transparent, image-only command buttons: reproduce WinForms FlatStyle.Flat +
             FlatAppearance.BorderSize=0 + BackColor.Transparent, and keep that face through
             hover/pressed (the Fluent template otherwise paints a hover/pressed fill). The
             pointerover/pressed setters target the template content presenter — the same technique
             used by the sibling FormRecordPickerView / FormSimCoordsView. -->
        <Style Selector="Button.imageButton">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.imageButton:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.imageButton:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
        </Style>

        <!-- panelChoose mode tiles: WinForms BackColor White + FlatStyle.Flat +
             FlatAppearance.BorderColor Black + Tahoma 12pt Bold. A ControlTemplate binds the face to
             the control's own Background so the White stays stable across pointerover/pressed (no
             Fluent recolor); the tile holds an image-only glyph (captions are separate TextBlocks). -->
        <Style Selector="Button.whiteButton">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="White" />
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="6" />
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="16" />
            <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Bold" />
            <Setter Property="Template">
                <ControlTemplate>
                    <ContentPresenter Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                                      BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                                      BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                                      Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                      Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                                      HorizontalContentAlignment="Center"
                                      VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter>
        </Style>

        <!-- nud* numeric DISPLAY buttons: reproduce the WinForms NudlessNumericUpDown (a read-only
             numeric up/down that pops a keypad on click). A ControlTemplate binds the face to the
             control's own Background so each instance's colour (LightCyan / AliceBlue) stays stable
             across hover/pressed. The code-behind assigns the value text (formatted with
             CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) and opens the keypad on click; per-button Background and
             FontSize are set inline below. -->
        <Style Selector="Button.nud">
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Gray" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="4,0" />
            <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Bold" />
            <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
            <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
            <Setter Property="Template">
                <ControlTemplate>
                    <ContentPresenter Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                                      BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                                      BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                                      Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                      Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                      Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                                      HorizontalContentAlignment="Center"
                                      VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter>
        </Style>

        <!-- Track-row cells (the three controls UpdateTable built per track). A ControlTemplate binds
             the face + text colour to each cell's own Background/Foreground (set by the row binding)
             so the selection/visibility colours stay stable across hover/pressed — reproducing the
             WinForms FlatStyle.Flat buttons whose BackColor/ForeColor are driven entirely by code. -->
        <Style Selector="Button.trackCell">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Template">
                <ControlTemplate>
                    <ContentPresenter Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                                      Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                      Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                      Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                                      HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                                      VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}" />
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter>
        </Style>

    </Window.Styles>

    <!--
        Root Canvas. Every sub-panel is itself a <Canvas> pinned at (3,3) (FormBuildTracks_Load moves
        ALL panels to that origin); the code-behind toggles IsVisible to show exactly one at a time,
        and resizes the window to suit. Only panelMain starts visible. Children within each panel use
        within-panel Canvas.Left/Canvas.Top equal to their WinForms Designer Location.
    -->
    <Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelMain — the track LIST (630 x 425, WhiteSmoke). The only panel visible at
             startup. Left column = list-management buttons; the white flp list fills the
             centre; right column = move/visibility/new/use buttons.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelMain"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="630"
                Height="425"
                Background="WhiteSmoke"
                IsVisible="True">

            <!-- btnListDelete — delete the selected track (Resources.Trash). (16,6) 54 x 54. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnListDelete"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="16"
                    Canvas.Top="6"
                    Width="54"
                    Height="54"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Delete Track">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Trash.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnEditName — rename the selected track (Resources.FileEditName). (4,102) 71 x 63. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnEditName"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="4"
                    Canvas.Top="102"
                    Width="71"
                    Height="63"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Edit Name">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/FileEditName.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnDuplicate — duplicate the selected track (Resources.FileCopy). (4,186) 71 x 63. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnDuplicate"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="4"
                    Canvas.Top="186"
                    Width="71"
                    Height="63"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Duplicate">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/FileCopy.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnSwapAB — swap the A/B ends of the selected track (Resources.ABSwapPoints).
                 (4,270) 71 x 63. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnSwapAB"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="4"
                    Canvas.Top="270"
                    Width="71"
                    Height="63"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Swap A B">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABSwapPoints.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancelMain — close the dialog (Resources.Cancel64). (4,354) 78 x 57. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancelMain"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="4"
                    Canvas.Top="354"
                    Width="78"
                    Height="57"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- flp — the track list. WinForms FlowLayoutPanel at (88,8) 450 x 399, white. Here a
                 ScrollViewer (flpScroll, named so the code-behind can adjust its offset for
                 touch-drag scrolling) hosts the ItemsControl flp. The code-behind assigns flp.Items
                 / ItemsSource (the row view-type collection) and attaches the bubbled row handlers. -->
            <ScrollViewer x:Name="flpScroll"
                          Canvas.Left="88"
                          Canvas.Top="8"
                          Width="450"
                          Height="399"
                          Background="White"
                          VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                          HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                <ItemsControl x:Name="flp">
                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                        <DataTemplate>
                            <!-- One track row = mode icon (b) -> name (t) -> visible toggle (a),
                                 the exact WinForms flp.Controls.Add order. -->
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">

                                <!-- b: mode icon. 35 x 25, Margin(1,10,3,10), FlatStyle.Flat,
                                     no click (drag only). ModeImage = TrackLine/TrackPivot/TrackCurve. -->
                                <Button Classes="trackMode imageButton"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Track mode icon"
                                        Width="35"
                                        Height="25"
                                        Margin="1,10,3,10"
                                        IsTabStop="False">
                                    <Image Source="{Binding ModeImage}" Stretch="Uniform" />
                                </Button>

                                <!-- t: name button. 330 x 40, Margin(3), Tahoma 18pt (24 DIP),
                                     MiddleLeft. Click selects (code-behind). BackColor LightBlue when
                                     selected else AliceBlue; ForeColor Black when visible else Gray. -->
                                <Button Classes="trackName trackCell"
                                        Width="330"
                                        Height="40"
                                        Margin="3"
                                        FontSize="24"
                                        HorizontalContentAlignment="Left"
                                        VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                        Content="{Binding Name}"
                                        Background="{Binding NameBackground}"
                                        Foreground="{Binding NameForeground}" />

                                <!-- a: visible toggle. 40 x 25, Margin(20,10,2,10). Click toggles
                                     visibility (code-behind). BackColor Green when visible else Red. -->
                                <Button Classes="trackVisible trackCell"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Toggle track visibility"
                                        Width="40"
                                        Height="25"
                                        Margin="20,10,2,10"
                                        Background="{Binding VisibleBackground}" />

                            </StackPanel>
                        </DataTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                </ItemsControl>
            </ScrollViewer>

            <!-- btnMoveUp — move the selected track up the list (Resources.UpArrow64). (545,6) 78 x 57. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnMoveUp"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="545"
                    Canvas.Top="6"
                    Width="78"
                    Height="57"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Move Up">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/UpArrow64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnMoveDn — move the selected track down the list (Resources.DnArrow64). (545,79) 78 x 57. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnMoveDn"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="545"
                    Canvas.Top="79"
                    Width="78"
                    Height="57"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Move Down">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/DnArrow64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnHideShow — toggle hide/show of all tracks (Resources.ABLinesHideShow). (545,160) 78 x 57. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnHideShow"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="545"
                    Canvas.Top="160"
                    Width="78"
                    Height="57"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Hide Show">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABLinesHideShow.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnNewTrack — start the new-track chooser (Resources.AddNew). (545,258) 78 x 57. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnNewTrack"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="545"
                    Canvas.Top="258"
                    Width="78"
                    Height="57"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="New Track">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/AddNew.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnListUse — accept / use the selected track (Resources.OK64). (545,356) 78 x 57. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnListUse"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="545"
                    Canvas.Top="356"
                    Width="78"
                    Height="57"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Use">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelChoose — the new-track MODE chooser (630 x 425, Gainsboro). Eight white
             mode tiles (each with a caption TextBlock) plus Cancel. Reached from
             panelMain btnNewTrack.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelChoose"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="630"
                Height="425"
                Background="Gainsboro"
                IsVisible="False">

            <!-- btnLatLonPivotCircle — Lat/Lon pivot circle (Resources.ABPivotCircle). (89,10) 100 x 107. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnLatLonPivotCircle"
                    Classes="whiteButton"
                    Canvas.Left="89"
                    Canvas.Top="10"
                    Width="100"
                    Height="107"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Lat Lon Pivot Circle">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABPivotCircle.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnLoadABFromKML — import a track from KML (Resources.BoundaryLoadFromGE). (89,152) 100 x 107. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnLoadABFromKML"
                    Classes="whiteButton"
                    Canvas.Left="89"
                    Canvas.Top="152"
                    Width="100"
                    Height="107"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Load AB From KML">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/BoundaryLoadFromGE.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnzLatLon — Lat/Lon + Lat/Lon (Resources.ABLatLonLatLon). (265,10) 100 x 107. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnzLatLon"
                    Classes="whiteButton"
                    Canvas.Left="265"
                    Canvas.Top="10"
                    Width="100"
                    Height="107"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Lat Lon Lat Lon">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABLatLonLatLon.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnzLatLonPlusHeading — Lat/Lon + heading (Resources.ABLatLonHeading). (265,153) 100 x 107. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnzLatLonPlusHeading"
                    Classes="whiteButton"
                    Canvas.Left="265"
                    Canvas.Top="153"
                    Width="100"
                    Height="107"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Lat Lon Plus Heading">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABLatLonHeading.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnLatLonPivot — Lat/Lon pivot (Resources.ABPivot). (265,296) 100 x 107. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnLatLonPivot"
                    Classes="whiteButton"
                    Canvas.Left="265"
                    Canvas.Top="296"
                    Width="100"
                    Height="107"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Lat Lon Pivot">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABPivot.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnzAPlus — A+ track (Resources.ABTrackA+ -> btnImages/ABTrackA+.png; literal '+'). (468,10) 100 x 107. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnzAPlus"
                    Classes="whiteButton"
                    Canvas.Left="468"
                    Canvas.Top="10"
                    Width="100"
                    Height="107"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="A Plus">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABTrackA+.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnzABLine — AB line (Resources.ABTrackAB). (468,153) 100 x 107. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnzABLine"
                    Classes="whiteButton"
                    Canvas.Left="468"
                    Canvas.Top="153"
                    Width="100"
                    Height="107"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="AB Line">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABTrackAB.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnzABCurve — AB curve (Resources.ABTrackCurve). (468,296) 100 x 107. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnzABCurve"
                    Classes="whiteButton"
                    Canvas.Left="468"
                    Canvas.Top="296"
                    Width="100"
                    Height="107"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="AB Curve">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABTrackCurve.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancelChoose — back/cancel out of the chooser (Resources.Cancel64), transparent flat.
                 (5,338) 90 x 80. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancelChoose"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="5"
                    Canvas.Top="338"
                    Width="90"
                    Height="80"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- Caption labels (Tahoma 9.75pt = 13 DIP). Text = WinForms designer defaults; the
                 code-behind (re)assigns the translated gStr captions at runtime. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="label2" Canvas.Left="122" Canvas.Top="121" FontSize="13" Text="Pivot" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelABCurve" Canvas.Left="107" Canvas.Top="265" FontSize="13" Text="AB + Curve" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLatLon" Canvas.Left="294" Canvas.Top="120" FontSize="13" Text="Lat/Lon" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLatLonHeading" Canvas.Left="290" Canvas.Top="263" FontSize="13" Text="Lat/Lon +" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelAPlus" Canvas.Left="506" Canvas.Top="121" FontSize="13" Text="A+" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelABLine" Canvas.Left="496" Canvas.Top="264" FontSize="13" Text="AB Line" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelPivot" Canvas.Left="288" Canvas.Top="406" FontSize="13" Text="Pivot" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelCurve2" Canvas.Left="499" Canvas.Top="406" FontSize="13" Text="Curve" />

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelCurve — record/build an AB CURVE track (241 x 310, White). btnRefSideCurve,
             btnACurve and btnPausePlay swap their glyph at runtime, so each carries a NAMED
             child <Image> the code-behind retargets.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelCurve"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241"
                Height="310"
                Background="White"
                IsVisible="False">

            <TextBlock x:Name="labelCurve" Canvas.Left="4" Canvas.Top="4" FontSize="13" Text="Curve" />

            <!-- btnRefSideCurve — reference side toggle. Default Resources.BoundaryRight; the
                 code-behind swaps imgRefSideCurve.Source to BoundaryLeft when the ref side flips. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnRefSideCurve"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="88"
                    Canvas.Top="2"
                    Width="70"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Reference Side">
                <Image x:Name="imgRefSideCurve" Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/BoundaryRight.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnACurve — mark point A / add point. Default Resources.LetterABlue; the code-behind
                 swaps imgACurve.Source to PointAdd while recording. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnACurve"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="7"
                    Canvas.Top="97"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="A">
                <Image x:Name="imgACurve" Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/LetterABlue.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnPausePlay — pause/resume recording. Default Resources.boundaryPause; the
                 code-behind swaps imgPausePlay.Source to PointDelete / BoundaryRecord per state. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnPausePlay"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="146"
                    Canvas.Top="97"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Pause Play">
                <Image x:Name="imgPausePlay" Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/boundaryPause.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- labelStatus / lblCurveExists — recording status readout (Tahoma 14.25pt Bold = 19 DIP).
                 lblCurveExists default "> OFF <"; the code-behind sets gStr.gsDriving etc. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelStatus" Canvas.Left="36" Canvas.Top="195" Width="84" Height="23"
                       FontSize="19" FontWeight="Bold" Text="Status: " />
            <TextBlock x:Name="lblCurveExists" Canvas.Left="111" Canvas.Top="195" Width="91" Height="23"
                       FontSize="19" FontWeight="Bold" Text="&gt; OFF &lt;" />

            <!-- btnCancel_Curve — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (7,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_Curve"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="7"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnBCurve — accept point B / finish (Resources.OK64). (146,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnBCurve"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="146"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="B">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelABLine — build a straight AB line (241 x 310, White). btnRefSideAB swaps its
             glyph; btnBLine carries a named child <Image> (the code-behind also sets the button
             BackColor to Teal once B is captured).
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelABLine"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241"
                Height="310"
                Background="White"
                IsVisible="False">

            <TextBlock x:Name="labelABLine2" Canvas.Left="5" Canvas.Top="4" FontSize="13" Text="AB Line" />

            <!-- btnRefSideAB — reference side toggle. Default BoundaryRight; code-behind swaps
                 imgRefSideAB.Source to BoundaryLeft. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnRefSideAB"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="90"
                    Canvas.Top="3"
                    Width="70"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Reference Side">
                <Image x:Name="imgRefSideAB" Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/BoundaryRight.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnALine — mark point A (Resources.LetterABlue). (4,110) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnALine"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="4"
                    Canvas.Top="110"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="A">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/LetterABlue.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnBLine — mark point B (Resources.LetterBBlue). (147,110) 88 x 70. The code-behind
                 sets this button's Background to Teal once B is captured; imgBLine is the named
                 glyph so the code-behind can adjust it if needed. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnBLine"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="147"
                    Canvas.Top="110"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="B">
                <Image x:Name="imgBLine" Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/LetterBBlue.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancel_ABLine — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (8,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_ABLine"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="8"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnEnter_AB — accept (Resources.OK64). (142,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnEnter_AB"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="142"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Enter">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelAPlus — build an A+ track (A point plus a typed heading) (241 x 310, White).
             btnRefSideAPlus swaps its glyph; nudHeading is a keypad-backed numeric display.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelAPlus"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241"
                Height="310"
                Background="White"
                IsVisible="False">

            <TextBlock x:Name="labelAPlus2" Canvas.Left="6" Canvas.Top="4" FontSize="13" Text="A+" />

            <!-- btnRefSideAPlus — reference side toggle. Default BoundaryRight; code-behind swaps
                 imgRefSideAPlus.Source to BoundaryLeft. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnRefSideAPlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="26"
                    Canvas.Top="35"
                    Width="70"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Reference Side">
                <Image x:Name="imgRefSideAPlus" Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/BoundaryRight.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnAPlus — mark point A (Resources.LetterABlue). (140,26) 80 x 78. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnAPlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="140"
                    Canvas.Top="26"
                    Width="80"
                    Height="78"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="A">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/LetterABlue.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- nudHeading — typed heading (NudlessNumericUpDown, DecimalPlaces 4). (9,146) 221 x 52,
                 LightCyan, Tahoma 27.75pt Bold (37 DIP), design value "0". Code-behind opens the
                 keypad on click and assigns the value (CultureInfo.InvariantCulture). -->
            <Button x:Name="nudHeading"
                    Classes="nud"
                    Canvas.Left="9"
                    Canvas.Top="146"
                    Width="221"
                    Height="52"
                    Background="LightCyan"
                    FontSize="37"
                    Content="0"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Heading" />

            <!-- btnCancel_APlus — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (8,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_APlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="8"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnEnter_APlus — accept (Resources.OK64). (142,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnEnter_APlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="142"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Enter">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelName — name a NEW track (241 x 310, White). A multiline name entry, a
             "+ time-stamp" helper, plus accept/cancel.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelName"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241"
                Height="310"
                Background="White"
                IsVisible="False">

            <TextBlock x:Name="labelEnterName" Canvas.Left="16" Canvas.Top="14" FontSize="13" Text="Add Name" />

            <!-- textBox1 — track name entry. WinForms BackColor LightCyan, BorderStyle FixedSingle,
                 Multiline, Tahoma 14.25pt (19 DIP). (17,37) 204 x 77. -->
            <TextBox x:Name="textBox1"
                     AutomationProperties.Name="Track name"
                     Canvas.Left="17"
                     Canvas.Top="37"
                     Width="204"
                     Height="77"
                     Background="LightCyan"
                     BorderBrush="Gray"
                     BorderThickness="1"
                     FontSize="19"
                     AcceptsReturn="True"
                     TextWrapping="Wrap" />

            <!-- label1 — the "+" between the name box and the time-stamp button. (48,154) 33 x 29,
                 Tahoma 18pt Bold (24 DIP). -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="label1" Canvas.Left="48" Canvas.Top="154" Width="33" Height="29"
                       FontSize="24" FontWeight="Bold" Text="+" />

            <!-- btnAddTime — append a time stamp to the name (Resources.JobNameTime). (87,133) 68 x 69. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnAddTime"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="87"
                    Canvas.Top="133"
                    Width="68"
                    Height="69"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Add Time">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/JobNameTime.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancel_Name — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (5,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_Name"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="5"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnAdd — accept the name (Resources.OK64). (141,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnAdd"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="141"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Add">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelEditName — rename an EXISTING track (241 x 310, White). Mirrors panelName with
             its own multiline entry and accept/cancel.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelEditName"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241"
                Height="310"
                Background="White"
                IsVisible="False">

            <TextBlock x:Name="labelEditName" Canvas.Left="22" Canvas.Top="14" FontSize="13" Text="Edit Name" />

            <!-- textBox2 — track name editor. WinForms BackColor LightCyan, BorderStyle FixedSingle,
                 Multiline, Tahoma 14.25pt (19 DIP). (17,37) 204 x 77. -->
            <TextBox x:Name="textBox2"
                     AutomationProperties.Name="Edit track name"
                     Canvas.Left="17"
                     Canvas.Top="37"
                     Width="204"
                     Height="77"
                     Background="LightCyan"
                     BorderBrush="Gray"
                     BorderThickness="1"
                     FontSize="19"
                     AcceptsReturn="True"
                     TextWrapping="Wrap" />

            <!-- label3 — the "+" between the name box and the time-stamp button. (48,154) Tahoma 18pt
                 Bold (24 DIP). -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="label3" Canvas.Left="48" Canvas.Top="154" Width="33" Height="29"
                       FontSize="24" FontWeight="Bold" Text="+" />

            <!-- btnAddTimeEdit — append a time stamp (Resources.JobNameTime). (87,133) 68 x 69. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnAddTimeEdit"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="87"
                    Canvas.Top="133"
                    Width="68"
                    Height="69"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Add Time">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/JobNameTime.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancel_EditName — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (5,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_EditName"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="5"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnSaveEditName — save the edited name (Resources.OK64). (141,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnSaveEditName"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="141"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Save">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelKML — KML import (241 x 310, White). Entering this panel immediately opens a file
             picker (code-behind); the only control is Cancel.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelKML"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241"
                Height="310"
                Background="White"
                IsVisible="False">

            <!-- btnCancel_KML — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (5,235) 88 x 70. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_KML"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="5"
                    Canvas.Top="235"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelLatLonPlus — build a track from a typed Lat/Lon plus a heading (341 x 425,
             Gainsboro). Three keypad-backed numeric displays, captions, a "fill from antenna"
             button, plus accept/cancel.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelLatLonPlus"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="341"
                Height="425"
                Background="Gainsboro"
                IsVisible="False">

            <!-- Captions (Tahoma 11.25pt = 15 DIP). The WinForms "Lattitude" spelling is preserved. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLatitude" Canvas.Left="90" Canvas.Top="38" FontSize="15" Text="Lattitude (+- 90)" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLongtitude" Canvas.Left="90" Canvas.Top="118" FontSize="15" Text="Longitude ( +- 180)" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelHeading" Canvas.Left="90" Canvas.Top="230" FontSize="15" Text="Heading" />

            <!-- nudLatitudePlus — DecimalPlaces 7, Tahoma 21.75pt (29 DIP), AliceBlue. (90,58) 228 x 43. -->
            <Button x:Name="nudLatitudePlus" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="90" Canvas.Top="58"
                    Width="228" Height="43" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="29"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Latitude" />

            <!-- nudLongitudePlus — DecimalPlaces 7, 29 DIP, AliceBlue. (90,138) 228 x 43. -->
            <Button x:Name="nudLongitudePlus" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="90" Canvas.Top="138"
                    Width="228" Height="43" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="29"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Longitude" />

            <!-- nudHeadingLatLonPlus — DecimalPlaces 4, Tahoma 24pt (32 DIP), AliceBlue. (90,250) 207 x 46. -->
            <Button x:Name="nudHeadingLatLonPlus" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="90" Canvas.Top="250"
                    Width="207" Height="46" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="32"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Heading" />

            <!-- btnFillLatLonPlus — fill from the current antenna position
                 (Resources.ConS_ImplementAntenna, btnImages/Config/). (6,97) 60 x 49. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnFillLatLonPlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="6"
                    Canvas.Top="97"
                    Width="60"
                    Height="49"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Fill From Antenna">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Config/ConS_ImplementAntenna.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancel_LatLonPlus — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (13,358) 63 x 60. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_LatLonPlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="13"
                    Canvas.Top="358"
                    Width="63"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnEnter_LatLonPlus — accept (Resources.OK64). (239,358) 88 x 60. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnEnter_LatLonPlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="239"
                    Canvas.Top="358"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Enter">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelLatLonLatLon — build an AB track from two typed Lat/Lon points (341 x 425,
             Gainsboro). Four numeric displays (A then B), captions, two "fill from antenna"
             buttons (A/B), big "A"/"B" markers, plus accept/cancel.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelLatLonLatLon"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="341"
                Height="425"
                Background="Gainsboro"
                IsVisible="False">

            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLatitudeA" Canvas.Left="81" Canvas.Top="7" FontSize="15" Text="Lattitude (+- 90)" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLongtitudeA" Canvas.Left="81" Canvas.Top="87" FontSize="15" Text="Longitude ( +- 180)" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLatitudeB" Canvas.Left="81" Canvas.Top="174" FontSize="15" Text="Lattitude (+- 90)" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLongtitudeB" Canvas.Left="81" Canvas.Top="253" FontSize="15" Text="Longitude ( +- 180)" />

            <!-- label23 / label24 — the big "A" / "B" point markers (Tahoma 18pt Bold = 24 DIP). -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="label23" Canvas.Left="247" Canvas.Top="74" FontSize="24" FontWeight="Bold" Text="A" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="label24" Canvas.Left="247" Canvas.Top="240" FontSize="24" FontWeight="Bold" Text="B" />

            <!-- Point A coordinates (DecimalPlaces 7, 29 DIP, AliceBlue). -->
            <Button x:Name="nudLatitudeA" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="81" Canvas.Top="27"
                    Width="228" Height="43" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="29"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Latitude A" />
            <Button x:Name="nudLongitudeA" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="81" Canvas.Top="107"
                    Width="228" Height="43" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="29"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Longitude A" />

            <!-- Point B coordinates (DecimalPlaces 7, 29 DIP, AliceBlue). -->
            <Button x:Name="nudLatitudeB" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="81" Canvas.Top="194"
                    Width="228" Height="43" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="29"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Latitude B" />
            <Button x:Name="nudLongitudeB" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="81" Canvas.Top="273"
                    Width="228" Height="43" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="29"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Longitude B" />

            <!-- btnFillLatLonLatLonA — fill point A from the antenna (Config/ConS_ImplementAntenna).
                 (6,66) 60 x 49. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnFillLatLonLatLonA"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="6"
                    Canvas.Top="66"
                    Width="60"
                    Height="49"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Fill A From Antenna">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Config/ConS_ImplementAntenna.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnFillLatLonLatLonB — fill point B from the antenna (Config/ConS_ImplementAntenna).
                 (6,232) 60 x 49. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnFillLatLonLatLonB"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="6"
                    Canvas.Top="232"
                    Width="60"
                    Height="49"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Fill B From Antenna">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Config/ConS_ImplementAntenna.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancelLatLonLatLon — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (13,358) 63 x 60. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancelLatLonLatLon"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="13"
                    Canvas.Top="358"
                    Width="63"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnEnter_LatLonLatLon — accept (Resources.OK64). (235,358) 88 x 60. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnEnter_LatLonLatLon"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="235"
                    Canvas.Top="358"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Enter">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- ============================================================================
             panelPivot — build a pivot track from a typed Lat/Lon (341 x 308, Gainsboro). Two
             numeric displays, captions, a "fill from antenna" button, plus accept/cancel.
             ============================================================================ -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelPivot"
                Canvas.Left="3"
                Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="341"
                Height="308"
                Background="Gainsboro"
                IsVisible="False">

            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLatitudePivot" Canvas.Left="101" Canvas.Top="38" FontSize="15" Text="Lattitude (+- 90)" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelLongtitudePivot" Canvas.Left="101" Canvas.Top="118" FontSize="15" Text="Longitude ( +- 180)" />

            <!-- nudLatitudePivot / nudLongitudePivot — DecimalPlaces 7, Tahoma 24pt (32 DIP), AliceBlue. -->
            <Button x:Name="nudLatitudePivot" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="72" Canvas.Top="58"
                    Width="253" Height="46" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="32"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Latitude" />
            <Button x:Name="nudLongitudePivot" Classes="nud" Canvas.Left="72" Canvas.Top="138"
                    Width="253" Height="46" Background="AliceBlue" FontSize="32"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Longitude" />

            <!-- btnFillLAtLonPivot — fill from the antenna (Config/ConS_ImplementAntenna). (6,95) 60 x 49. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnFillLAtLonPivot"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="6"
                    Canvas.Top="95"
                    Width="60"
                    Height="49"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Fill From Antenna">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Config/ConS_ImplementAntenna.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancel_Pivot — cancel (Resources.Cancel64). (10,245) 63 x 60. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_Pivot"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="10"
                    Canvas.Top="245"
                    Width="63"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnEnter_Pivot — accept (Resources.OK64). (236,245) 88 x 60. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnEnter_Pivot"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="236"
                    Canvas.Top="245"
                    Width="88"
                    Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Enter">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

        </Canvas>

        <!-- End of the eleven overlapping sub-panels (panelMain, panelChoose, panelCurve, panelABLine,
             panelAPlus, panelName, panelEditName, panelKML, panelLatLonPlus, panelLatLonLatLon,
             panelPivot). All pinned at (3,3); the code-behind shows exactly one at a time. -->

    </Canvas>
</Window>
